+// classifySuspension reads the effective state of one suspension.
+//
+// The deadline, not the reason string, decides whether a suspension is temporary:
+// cooldownReason builds the reason from an upstream error message, so a plain 401
+// produced "unauthorized" and hid the model even though the conductor was going to
+// retry that credential in thirty minutes. A lapsed deadline is reported as
+// suspensionNone because nothing clears the map entry until the next projection,
+// and an idle registry must not keep hiding a model whose cooldown ended.
+func classifySuspension(reason string, until time.Time, now time.Time) suspensionState {
+	if !until.IsZero() && !now.Before(until) {
